# BADA 3 runtime-derived takeoff and landing bank/load gate.
# Run with: IC research/pybada3-envelope-terminal
00:00:00.00>ECHO TEST INFO === BADA 3 TERMINAL LATERAL ENVELOPE GATE ===
00:00:00.05>ECHO TEST INFO Bounds and phase configuration come from the active model.
00:00:00.10>ECHO TEST EXPECT Duplicated takeoff and landing pairs remain phase-stable.
00:00:00.15>PLUGIN LOAD PYBADATEM
00:00:00.20>PLUGIN LOAD RESEARCHRECORDER
00:00:00.25>PERFMODEL BADA3
00:00:00.30>DT 0.05
00:00:00.35>DATE 11,8,2026,12:00:00
00:00:01.00>CRE B3TR,A320,41.300,2.100,90,200,180
00:00:01.05>CRE B3TE,A320,41.310,2.100,90,200,180
00:00:01.10>CRE B3DR,A320,41.330,2.100,90,1000,140
00:00:01.15>CRE B3DE,A320,41.340,2.100,90,1000,140
00:00:01.20>DYNAMICS B3TR TEM
00:00:01.25>DYNAMICS B3TE TEM
00:00:01.30>DYNAMICS B3DR TEM
00:00:01.35>DYNAMICS B3DE TEM
00:00:01.40>ALT B3TR 1000 100
00:00:01.45>ALT B3TE 1000 100
00:00:01.50>ALT B3DR 0 -500
00:00:01.55>ALT B3DE 0 -500
00:00:01.60>BANK B3TR 70
00:00:01.65>BANK B3TE 70
00:00:01.70>BANK B3DR 70
00:00:01.75>BANK B3DE 70
00:00:02.00>ENVELOPECHECKS B3TR CUSTOM BANK_ANGLE LOAD_FACTOR
00:00:02.05>ENVELOPECHECKS B3TE CUSTOM BANK_ANGLE LOAD_FACTOR
00:00:02.10>ENVELOPECHECKS B3DR CUSTOM BANK_ANGLE LOAD_FACTOR
00:00:02.15>ENVELOPECHECKS B3DE CUSTOM BANK_ANGLE LOAD_FACTOR
00:00:02.20>ENVELOPE B3TR REPORT
00:00:02.25>ENVELOPE B3TE ENFORCE
00:00:02.30>ENVELOPE B3DR REPORT
00:00:02.35>ENVELOPE B3DE ENFORCE
00:00:02.40>RECORDRESEARCH START pybada3-envelope-terminal.csv
00:00:03.00>ECHO TEST ACTION Commanding terminal pairs to turn with an excessive requested bank.
00:00:03.10>HDG B3TR 270
00:00:03.15>HDG B3TE 270
00:00:03.20>HDG B3DR 270
00:00:03.25>HDG B3DE 270
00:00:03.80>PERFSTATUS B3TR
00:00:03.85>PERFSTATUS B3TE
00:00:03.90>PERFSTATUS B3DR
00:00:03.95>PERFSTATUS B3DE
00:00:04.30>RECORDRESEARCH STOP
00:00:04.35>ECHO TEST INFO Run validate_bada3_lateral.py with --terminal.
00:00:04.50>HOLD
